This covers the portfolio *content* in this repository — the part that is the
work rather than the machinery:

  - Case studies and any written copy in src/content/
  - Images, media and design files, including public/og/ and
    src/content/projects/_media/
  - Biographical copy and the site's written text in src/config/site.ts
    and src/pages/
  - The written record in behind-the-scenes/ (the READMEs and agent-run logs)
  - The specific colour values, type choices and design decisions that make up
    this site's visual identity, in design/tokens.json and
    src/styles/tokens.css

You may read it, link to it, and quote short excerpts with attribution.
You may not republish it, present it as your own, or use it to train
generative models.

The *structure* is fair game — a flat token system named one-for-one with the
Figma variables, a "How might we" content schema, the design-to-code workflow.
Those are ideas, and ideas should travel. It is the specific expression that
stays mine.

